shape: sequence_diagram

title: A save that loses the etag {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 20
}

phone: Android
web: Web
api: Function App
cosmos: Cosmos

phone -> api: Save item and etag A
api -> cosmos: Replace if etag is A
cosmos -> api: Stored, etag B
api -> phone: 200
web -> api: Save same item and etag A
api -> cosmos: Replace if etag is A
cosmos -> api: Rejected
api -> web: 409 problem-details
web -> web: Snap the item back
web -> api: Reload this person's items
api -> cosmos: Read this person's items
cosmos -> api: Items, including etag B
api -> web: Items, including etag B
